  "message": "Use of File.createTempFile() without proper file permissions can lead to insecure temporary files. On Unix-like systems, the created files may have overly permissive permissions. The fix involves using java.nio.file.Files.createTempFile() with explicit PosixFilePermissions to ensure that temporary files are created with restrictive permissions (e.g., rw-------). This prevents potential information disclosure or privilege escalation attacks.",
  "severity": "WARNING",
  "metadata": {
    "category": "security",
    "cwe": "CWE-732",
    "owasp": "OWASP-A01:2021"
  }
}

